41
00:03:20,037 --> 00:03:20,997
[SPEAKER_02]: What would their understanding be?

42
00:03:22,158 --> 00:03:24,558
[SPEAKER_02]: They would conceive Earth.

43
00:03:26,139 --> 00:03:28,839
