00:05:02,792 --> 00:05:04,012
[SPEAKER_02]: I am imagining this.

66
00:05:04,373 --> 00:05:05,353
[SPEAKER_02]: And I'm placing that first.

67
00:05:05,433 --> 00:05:07,254
[SPEAKER_02]: And you're placing yourself first.

68
00:05:07,354 --> 00:05:07,534
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

69
00:05:07,914 --> 00:05:10,496
[SPEAKER_02]: You always place yourself first, and that's where the mind will not be established.

70
00:05:11,016 --> 00:05:16,260
