76
00:05:32,191 --> 00:05:32,351
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

77
00:05:32,472 --> 00:05:34,813
[SPEAKER_02]: Or discern that phenomenon as you are within it.

78
00:05:35,153 --> 00:05:35,354
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

79
00:05:35,554 --> 00:05:37,095
[SPEAKER_02]: So, that's how you start partaking

80
00:05:39,487 --> 00:05:39,847
