87
00:05:51,974 --> 00:05:57,577
[SPEAKER_02]: Even if your mind wants to care, it cannot step outside of the correctly established context of earth is first.

88
00:06:00,059 --> 00:06:06,943
[SPEAKER_02]: And then, any care that you have about what's said, or what you got, or what you didn't get, is within that context, which means it's no care at all.

